# Real party assets live in the night pack outside the repo (see CLAUDE.md).
# Both of these stay ignored: a checkout with no pack still falls back to
# content/local/, and the old public/local-assets/ path must never be committed
# from a worktree that predates the move.
apps/client/public/local-assets/
content/local/
# The online teaser's public dir is filled from the night pack (tools/build-teaser), and its
# build is a deploy artefact.
apps/client/teaser-public/
apps/client/dist-teaser/
